      "writtenOn": "2026-08-06T14:10:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think in this scenario (Filestream) exceptions, any negative error code is exposed to user space code.\nCould you please specify which specific use case you are worried about?",
      "parentUuid": "5aeca375_f66e7fd6",
      "revId": "a47424aaead35304c9d11faf418fa3bf7e1a8614",
